{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56161","headline":"六十甲子歌（题拟） 一 · 杜光庭","name":"六十甲子歌（题拟） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"甲子秋，耕民怀苦忧。\n禾苗不成实，灾厄害田畴。\n但看入秋後，高田不可守。\n辛苦临冬春，父子离乡走。\n兄弟成路人，妻子爆糊口。\n万姓悉灾迍，民随千里走。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56161.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56161","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}